From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 21:21:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ports/arkweb: Back the cookie manager with Servo's site-data
 manager

Wire the synchronous ArkWeb cookie API (fetchCookieSync/configCookieSync)
to Servo's SiteDataManager over the bridge with a servo-thread rendezvous:
ReturnCookie[WithHttpOnly] -> cookies_for_url (formatted as name=value
pairs), SetCookie[Sync/WithHttpOnly] -> set_cookie_for_url. The async
callback variants and per-cookie enumeration stay stubbed for now.

Validation: Test on device by loading a page that sets document.cookie, restarting the test app and verifying fetchCookieSync still returns it; no automated test yet.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implementation and on-device testing)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <jschwender@posteo.net>
---
 Cargo.lock                               |   1 +
 ports/arkweb/Cargo.toml                  |   1 +
 ports/arkweb/cpp/servo_stub_managers.cpp |  30 ++++++
 ports/arkweb/cpp/servo_stub_managers.h   |  15 ++-
 ports/arkweb/src/bridge.rs               |  14 +++
 ports/arkweb/src/runtime.rs              | 112 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 6 files changed, 169 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

